title: Analytics › Monthly report › Download the files
route: /analytics
intro: When the report is ready the window offers two real files, a written report and the figures as a table, and a Print button. In the hosted preview, where the host page blocks downloads and printing, the buttons only explain why nothing happens. There is no PDF file: Print hands the page to the browser's own print window.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the files hold exactly the figures on the page, and are named from the period, payer and program, for example psyflo-monthly-report-quarter-all-all.md.
---
start s1 "Window shows 'Your report is ready'"
screen sc "Three buttons\n'Download report' (dark)\n'Download data (CSV)'\n'Print'\nFooter button 'Done'"

click c1 "Click 'Download report'"
click c2 "Click 'Download data (CSV)'"
click c3 "Click 'Print'"
decision q2 "Is this the hosted preview?"
toast t3 "'Print is off in this preview'\n'Open the single-file version of the demo to use it.'"
process pp "The browser's print window opens\nIt prints a plain page of the report: title, period, scope, program and every section\nNot the sidebar, the menus or the window"
process pq "Cancel or Print in the browser window\nThe report window stays open"
decision q1 "Is this the hosted preview?\n(the host page blocks downloads and printing)"
toast t1 "'Download is off in this preview'\n'Open the single-file version of the demo to use it.'"
process p0 "No file is made and no second toast\nThe window stays open"

group gFile "In the single-file demo"
  doc f1 "Markdown file\npsyflo-monthly-report-quarter-all-all.md"
  doc f2 "CSV file\npsyflo-monthly-report-quarter-all-all.csv"
  process p1 "Browser saves the file to the person's computer"
  toast t2 "'Report downloaded'\n'psyflo-monthly-report-quarter-all-all.md has the figures you see on this page.'"
  process p2 "Window stays open, so the other file can be saved too"
endgroup

process n1 "Name pattern: psyflo-monthly-report, then the period (quarter, last_quarter, year), then the payer (all or cardinal, summit ...), then the program (all, res, iop, php or wm)"
doc d1 "Production, not in the demo\nOne PDF monthly pack, aggregate only, drafted on the first business day\nThe operator approves it before it is sent\nThe demo prints through the browser instead"

click k1 "Click 'Done', press Escape, click the X or click outside"
end e1 "Window closes, back on Analytics"
goto g1 "Continues in: Analytics › Monthly report › What the files contain"

s1 --> sc
sc --> c1 & c2 & c3
c3 --> q2
q2 -->|Yes| t3 --> k1
q2 -->|No| pp --> pq --> k1
c1 & c2 --> q1
q1 -->|Yes| t1 --> p0 --> k1
q1 -->|No| p1 --> t2 --> p2 --> k1
p1 --> f1 & f2
p1 -.-> n1
f1 & f2 --> g1
sc --> k1
k1 --> e1
sc -.-> d1
